	<string id="pf_story_legendary_stash_name"><text>Legendary stash</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_legendary_revealed_news"><text>The packet contained exact coordinates. A legendary stash has been marked on the map.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_legendary_searched_news"><text>The cache is real: weapons, medicine and equipment prepared for a long expedition.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_seen_news"><text>Someone is at the stash. A Monolith fighter is reciting his sermon.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_pendant_found_news"><text>An old pendant marked with three notches. Why does it feel familiar?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_learn_past_text_preacher_seen"><text>An armed Monolith fighter is at the stash. He has not finished reading the page in front of him.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_learn_past_text_preacher_choice"><text>The Monolith fighter has finished his sermon, but he is not shooting. He noticed me looking at the pendant. I can try talking to him.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_learn_past_text_preacher_dead"><text>The Monolith fighter is dead. I should search the body.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_learn_past_text_pendant"><text>The three notches on the pendant feel familiar. A new document hand-off is marked on the map.</text></string>

	<string id="pf_story_preacher_name"><text>Sergey Sverchkov</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_bio"><text>A Monolith fighter guarding the city center. No further information.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_1"><text>Stop. Stalker, why did you come here? You need to leave immediately.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_2"><text>I cannot leave.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_3"><text>You must leave. Now. My brothers are not as patient as I am.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_4"><text>Wait... I know your voice. Cricket?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_5"><text>How do you know that?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_6"><text>I think we were related... I was told I had never had a family. But I remember the pendant. It has three scratches. I made them for my older brother.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_7"><text>That cannot be. They told me Anton died. But you really do look like him. The scars on your hands... and your voice.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_8"><text>...</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_9"><text>Give me time to think... Leave me alone for a while. I will ask my brothers not to touch you. But do not harm any of them.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_preacher_spare_10"><text>All right. I will give you time.</text></string>

	<string id="pf_story_brother_pendant_name"><text>Three-notched pendant</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_brother_pendant_descr"><text>%c[255,240,190,70]Important clue%c[255,216,186,140]\n \nA cheap, tarnished pendant with three short\nhand-cut notches.\nIt belonged to a Monolith fighter.</text></string>

	<string id="pf_story_path_continues_achievement_name"><text>This is not the end of the road...</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_path_continues_achievement_hint"><text>Sergey must remain alive\nuntil Document #12 is obtained.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_path_continues_achievement_descr"><text>You have not made a mistake yet.\nPerhaps something can still be changed...</text></string>
	<string id="pf_story_path_continues_achievement_news"><text>Achievement: "This is not the end of the road..."\nYou have not made a mistake yet.\nPerhaps something can still be changed...</text></string>

	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_name"><text>Keeper</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_bio"><text>A senior keeper of the Monolith archive. He remains at the faction base and collects testimony about the dead city.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_greeting"><text>What did you want from a servant of the Monolith?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_1"><text>Sergey called you his brother. That is enough for you to speak\nwith me. Yes, they call me the Keeper. I preserve what the city\nhas not yet taken from the living.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_2"><text>Are you the Keeper?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_4"><text>How can I help you?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_5"><text>The Notes of the Dead City. I will buy them, but loose pages\nare of no use to me. Bring me a complete part of the collection.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_6"><text>How many notes do you need?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_7"><text>Bring me twelve first. Then grow the collection to eighteen,\ntwenty-four, and finally thirty-six notes.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_intro_close_actor"><text>Understood.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_repeat_start_actor"><text>[Notes] Notes of the Dead City.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_repeat_1"><text>You have returned. Are the Notes of the Dead City with you?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_repeat_2"><text>I am still collecting them.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_repeat_3"><text>Then do not rush. The next milestones are twelve, eighteen,\ntwenty-four, and all thirty-six notes.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_continue_actor"><text>Let us continue.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_sections_keeper"><text>What else interests you?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_12_actor"><text>I have the first twelve notes. Take them.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_12_keeper"><text>The first part of the archive is restored.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_18_actor"><text>I brought six more. You now have eighteen notes.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_18_keeper"><text>The collection grows.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_24_actor"><text>Here are the next six. That makes twenty-four.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_24_keeper"><text>The city reveals more than it would wish.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_36_actor"><text>The final twelve. All thirty-six notes are assembled.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_exchange_36_keeper"><text>The archive is complete.\nThese notes preserve real stories of people: their lives before the accident,\nthe first hours of the catastrophe, the evacuation, and the fates of those\nwho fought the fire, dealt with its aftermath, and lost their homes forever.\nThank you for collecting them. It means a great deal to us.\nI have prepared a reward for you: the suit I once wore.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_artifacts_start_actor"><text>[Artefacts] Trade for stash coordinates.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_artifacts_offer_keeper"><text>One ordinary third-rank artefact for the coordinates of one\nred stash. Choose it from your rucksack.\nI do not take quest specimens or anything from your belt.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_gravi_actor"><text>I will give you Gravi.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_gravi_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Gravi?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_gold_fish_actor"><text>I will give you Goldfish.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_gold_fish_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Goldfish?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_eye_actor"><text>I will give you Eye.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_eye_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Eye?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_fire_actor"><text>I will give you Flame.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_fire_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Flame?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_baloon_actor"><text>I will give you Bubble.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_baloon_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Bubble?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_glass_actor"><text>I will give you Firefly.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_glass_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Firefly?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_dummy_dummy_actor"><text>I will give you Shell.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_dummy_dummy_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Shell?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_ice_actor"><text>I will give you Snowflake.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_group_ice_keeper"><text>What will you add to the Snowflake?</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_pair_gravi_gravi"><text>Exchange: Gravi + Gravi.</text></string>
