	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_artifacts_accept_keeper"><text>The exchange is complete. The red stash coordinates are already in your PDA.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_artifacts_decline_actor"><text>I will keep the artefacts for now.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_artifacts_decline_keeper"><text>Return when you decide.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_red_stash_revealed"><text>The Keeper has shared the coordinates of a red stash.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_leave_actor"><text>[Leave] Nothing else.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_monolith_guardian_leave_keeper"><text>May the Monolith guide your path.</text></string>

	<string id="pf_guardian_compass_name"><text>Keeper's Compass</text></string>
	<string id="pf_guardian_compass_descr"><text>%c[255,240,190,70]Unique artefact%c[255,216,186,140]\n \nA special Compass from the Keeper's archive. While worn on the belt,\nit grants +8 stamina recovery and +5% sprint speed.\nRecovery remains active while running. It does not degrade.</text></string>
	<string id="pf_guardian_seva_outfit_name"><text>Keeper's SEVA</text></string>
	<string id="pf_guardian_seva_outfit_descr"><text>%c[255,240,190,70]Unique Monolith suit%c[255,216,186,140]\n \nThe Keeper's old personal SEVA, preserved in immaculate condition and given in gratitude for restoring the complete archive of the dead city. Its integrated purification system continuously removes radiation.</text></string>
